         <description>Portion of land that is not covered by any biotic or abiotic material, because of fire, deforestation or other human interventions. The land may show regrowth of natural vegetation after the interventions.</description>
         <name>Bare soil</name>
         <map_code>BSo</map_code>
         <elements>
            <LC_HorizontalPattern id="2F" uuid="232b00f0-9ae2-11ec-9aae-f0d5bf59e8a0" xsi:type="LC_HorizontalPattern">
