         <description>Areas with allotted residential and commercial housing. Includes artificial surfaces and buildings.  The distance between buildings and other constructions is less than 5 meters, with scattered vegetation (e.g., parks) and small backyard agriculture. </description>
         <name>Dense urban area</name>
         <map_code>DUA</map_code>
